<h1>About the after app</h1>
<p>The modernized AdventureWorks.Web: ASP.NET Core on .NET 10 with a DynamoDB data layer (AWS SDK for .NET). One single-table design per domain;
this app reads and writes <code>aw-catalog</code>, <code>aw-customer</code> and <code>aw-sales</code>. See docs/modernization/app.md.</p>
